{"id":"841985de31202f85","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["89-df-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","depends_on":["[[88-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized theory in\nan arithmetized proof calculus.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb{N}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(y)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Len}(y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y)_i\">\\((y)_i\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Last}(y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Last}(y)\\)</span> are the fixed primitive-recursive coding operations for finite sequences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is the arithmetical predicate saying that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> codes an axiom of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleApp}_{T}(y,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleApp}_{T}(y,i)\\)</span> is the arithmetical predicate saying that line <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> of the sequence coded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> follows from earlier lines by a rule of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The displayed primitive-recursive relations have fixed arithmetical\nrepresenting formulas in the language of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{T}(y,x)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Seq}(y)\\land0&lt;\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\land\\mathrm{Last}(y)=x\\land\n\\forall i&lt;\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}_{T}((y)_i)\\lor\\mathrm{RuleApp}_{T}(y,i)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{T}(y,x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{T}(y,x)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Seq}(y)\\land0&lt;\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\land\\mathrm{Last}(y)=x\\land\n\\forall i&lt;\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}_{T}((y)_i)\\lor\\mathrm{RuleApp}_{T}(y,i)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{T}(y,x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> : the\nobject-language sentence saying that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> proves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>中的证明</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span> denote the\narithmetical formulas representing these relations; they are not\nfunctions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> or\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Len}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"(y)_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Last}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RuleApp}_{T}(y,i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{T}(y,x)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Seq}(y)\\land0<\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\land\\mathrm{Last}(y)=x\\land\n\\forall i<\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}_{T}((y)_i)\\lor\\mathrm{RuleApp}_{T}(y,i)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{T}(y,x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y, x)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1824,"backlinks":[{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is the one-free-variable arithmetical\nprovability formula fixed in [[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"00938a3b569dba72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is its standard one-free-variable provability\nformula from [[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"bf19f2410ce0d03b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"该记号与 [[89-df-provability-predicate]] 中作用于 Gödel 编码的\n$\\mathrm{Len}(y)$ 区分开。"},{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depe